  monsterId: 20cc58e7283b4d6d9ce7d5940324a2c1
  displayName: Zombie
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 583ec6a475b117340be744d71785ebdd, type: 3}
  description: Zombies are shambling undead, roughly human-sized, with rotting flesh
    and skin. They move with a dragging, very slow gait, often stumbling or falling
    and then rising again. They do not truly speak; at most they emit low, unconscious
    groans and wet gurgles, so they are effectively silent in terms of language or
    meaningful sound.
